  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Note: This recipe is designed to be cooked with your child under adult supervision.\n• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut potato into wedges.\n• Place wedges on a lined oven tray. Season with salt, drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle over sesame seeds and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide between two trays. Little cooks: Help with sprinkling over the sesame seeds and tossing the potato.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c52686f4b525c8eb5da913-a933fd1e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the wedges are baking, thinly slice spring onion.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Finely chop tomato.\n• Drain sweetcorn. Little cooks: Older kids can help out with the can opener under adult supervision.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c52686f4b525c8eb5da913-b224baac.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook corn, carrot and veggie mince, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add tomato paste, the water and Aussie spice blend. Cook until slightly reduced, 1-2 minutes. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c52686f4b525c8eb5da913-83349098.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle Cheddar cheese over the mince mixture, then cover with a lid (or foil) and allow to melt, 1 minute. Little cooks: Add the finishing touch by sprinkling the cheese on top.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c52686f4b525c8eb5da913-4a5a76e4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a small bowl, combine tomato, spring onion, a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c52686f4b525c8eb5da913-042a15ee.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide potato wedges between plates.\n• Top with the cheesy plant-based mince mixture and the seasoned tomato and spring onions.\n• Drizzle over burger sauce to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c52686f4b525c8eb5da913-a1c5b2dc.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
